rición en mujeres embarazadas, requiriendo atención nutricional especial.", "TRAUMATISMO PENETRANTE:El traumatismo penetrante es una lesión grave que puede requerir soporte nutricional en pacientes con un índice de gravedad elevado.", "TRAUMATISMO ABDOMINAL:El traumatismo abdominal es una condición médica que puede llevar a la necesidad de nutrición parenteral en pacientes gravemente heridos.", "FÍSTULAS ENTERO-CUTÁNEAS:Las fístulas entero-cutáneas son complicaciones que pueden surgir en pacientes con problemas digestivos, afectando la nutrición y el tratamiento.", "FÓRMULAS INMUNOMODULADORAS:FÓRMULAS INMUNOMODULADORAS are specialized enteral nutrition formulas designed to provide nutritional support for patients in various critical conditions, such as those undergoing cancer surgery or experiencing trauma. These immunomodulatory formulas contain specific nutrients aimed at influencing disease processes and enhancing the nutritional status of the patient. While they may offer benefits to certain critical patients, their use is not routine in clinical practice.", "NEOPLASIA GÁSTRICA:Neoplasia gástrica refers to gastric neoplasia, a condition that may require nutritional support and specific dietary management pre- and post-surgery.", "NEOPLASIA DE COLON:Neoplasia de colon refers to colon neoplasia, which involves dietary considerations and nutritional support following surgical interventions.", "FÍSTULAS INTESTINALES:Fístulas intestinales are intestinal fistulas that can lead to severe malnutrition and require careful nutritional management and treatment.", "GASTRECTOMÍA TOTAL:Gastrecomía total is a surgical procedure that involves the complete removal of the stomach, necessitating specific nutritional management.", "YEYUNOSTOMÍA DE ALIMENTACIÓN:Yeyunostomía de alimentación is a surgical procedure that creates an opening in the jejunum for feeding, often used in patients with gastrointestinal issues.", "DIETA POLIMÉRICA:DIETA POLIMÉRICA refers to a polymeric diet, which is a form of enteral nutrition designed for patients who can digest food normally. This diet contains whole proteins and offers a balanced mix of nutrients, making it suitable for individuals with specific dietary needs. It is commonly utilized in clinical settings to support the nutritional requirements of patients.", "DIETA OLIGOPEPTÍDICA:Dieta oligopeptídica is a specialized diet consisting of short-chain peptides, used for patients with malabsorption issues or specific gastrointestinal conditions.", "GASTRECTOMÍA SUBTOTAL:", "P. JUSTO PAVIA:P. Justo Pavia is a medical professional and author who has made significant contributions to the field of medicine, particularly in the areas of polytraumatism, traumatic brain injury, and the care of burn patients. In the referenced text, P. Justo Pavia is noted for contributing to a chapter focused on polytraumatism and traumatic brain injury, as well as another chapter that addresses the management of burn patients and the role of artificial nutrition in their treatment.", "TRAUMATIC BRAIN INJURY (TCE):Traumatic brain injury (TCE) refers to the brain damage resulting from trauma, which significantly affects the metabolic response and nutritional needs of patients."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}